 De Giorgio - Engagement Letter Klavitorix B.V.","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-19","description":"We are missing the engagement letter of Trevor De Giorgio as compliance officer of Klavitorix B.V. Kindly note the letter needs to be signed by the managing director and the compline officer.","notes":null},{"title":"Trevor De Giorgio - Birth Certificate","tag":"Birth Certificate","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-19","description":"The provided birth certificate is incorrect. Please provide a certified copy of the birth certificate issued by the relevant authority in Saudi Arabia. Kindly note that if the birth certificate is not in English, a certified translation in English must also be provided. The document certification(s) must in English and not be older than 6 months.","notes":null},{"title":"Klavitorix B.V.- Declaration of Good Standing","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-07","description":"The provided Declaration of Good Standing is incorrect. The Declaration of Good Standing (verzoek verklaring betalings gedrag) confirms compliance with tax and social contribution obligations. (to be obtained from the tax authority). Kindly submit a certified true copy of the document under the extra documentation section and name the file Declaration of Good Standing. If the document is not in English, an English translation (certified by the translator) must also be submitted.","notes":null}]},{"name":"Phase 1 - Due Diligence","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"Compliance Officer","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-17","description":"Please provide an explanation regarding the conflicts of Trevor De Giorgio being a UBO and compliance officer for other competing companies.","notes":null},{"title":"QPA/2025/03407 - Nana Gugeshashvili - Short PHDF","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-24","description":"The PHDF submitted was not the Short PHDF.","notes":null}]},{"name":"AML Policy","criticality":"Critical","items":[]},{"name":"KYC Policy","criticality":"Critical","items":[]},{"name":"Responsible Gaming Policy","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-01","description":"The RG policy must contain a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling. The key monitoring factors include: - Deposit and wagering frequency - Repeated failed transactions due to insufficient funds - Reversing withdrawals - A pattern of inexplicable extended play sessions - Unreasonable increased communication with customer support, including requests for bonuses - Frequent changes to RG tools - Players maxing out a credit card - Attempts to open multiple accounts to bypass deposit or loss limits","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-05-01","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors, such as safeguarding usernames, passwords and payment details.","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-01","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours.","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-01","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line with the operator's target player and/or market.","notes":null}]},{"name":"Player Complaints Policy","criticality":"Critical","items":[]}]}]}